.SH NAME
owasp\-a08 \- Software or Data Integrity Failures (OWASP Top 10:2025 A08)
.SH RANK
OWASP Top 10:2025 rank \fB#8\fR (A08:2021 Software and Data Integrity Failures).
.SH DESCRIPTION
Untrusted code or data is treated as trusted: unsigned updates, deserialization of untrusted data, plugins from a CDN without integrity checks. Lower layer than A03 supply chain.
.PP
This page is an overlay. Vulnerable\->fixed code lives on the \fBcwe\-*\fR(7) pages listed below, not here.
